rule thuisbatterij_aanvraag_volledig_awb_4_5_1 with provenance the model at decision Thuisbatterij aanvraag volledig Awb 4 5:
the is_complete of the thuisbatterij aanvraag volledig awb_4_5 is a truth value if
    it is not the case that the gemaakte kosten is a number
    and the truth value is equal to false
    otherwise the gemaakte kosten is a number N
    and N <= 0
    and the truth value is equal to false
    otherwise it is not the case that the relatie tot woning is a text
    and the truth value is equal to false
    otherwise the relatie tot woning is "huurder"
    and the toestemming eigenaar is false
    and the truth value is equal to false
    otherwise the relatie tot woning is "huurder"
    and it is not the case that the toestemming eigenaar is a second truth value
    and the truth value is equal to false
    otherwise it is not the case that the provincie woning is a second text
    and the truth value is equal to false
    otherwise it is not the case that the aanvraag datum is a third text
    and the truth value is equal to false
    otherwise the truth value is equal to true.

rule thuisbatterij_aanvraag_volledig_awb_4_5_2 with provenance the model at decision Thuisbatterij aanvraag volledig Awb 4 5:
the missing fields of the thuisbatterij aanvraag volledig awb_4_5 is a text if
    it is not the case that the gemaakte kosten is a number
    and the text is equal to "De gemaakte kosten ontbreken."
    otherwise the gemaakte kosten is a number N
    and N <= 0
    and the text is equal to "De gemaakte kosten ontbreken."
    otherwise it is not the case that the relatie tot woning is a second text
    and the text is equal to "De relatie van de aanvrager tot de woning ontbreekt."
    otherwise the relatie tot woning is "huurder"
    and the toestemming eigenaar is false
    and the text is equal to "De toestemming van de eigenaar van de woning ontbreekt."
    otherwise the relatie tot woning is "huurder"
    and it is not the case that the toestemming eigenaar is a truth value
    and the text is equal to "De toestemming van de eigenaar van de woning ontbreekt."
    otherwise it is not the case that the provincie woning is a third text
    and the text is equal to "De provincie waarin de woning ligt ontbreekt."
    otherwise it is not the case that the aanvraag datum is a fourth text
    and the text is equal to "De datum van aanvraag ontbreekt."
    otherwise the text is equal to "Geen ontbrekende gegevens.".

rule thuisbatterij_aanvraag_volledig_awb_4_5_3 with provenance the model at decision Thuisbatterij aanvraag volledig Awb 4 5:
the awb article of the thuisbatterij aanvraag volledig awb_4_5 is a text if
    it is not the case that the gemaakte kosten is a number
    and the text is equal to "Awb 4:5 - aanvraag onvolledig"
    otherwise the gemaakte kosten is a number N
    and N <= 0
    and the text is equal to "Awb 4:5 - aanvraag onvolledig"
    otherwise it is not the case that the relatie tot woning is a second text
    and the text is equal to "Awb 4:5 - aanvraag onvolledig"
    otherwise the relatie tot woning is "huurder"
    and the toestemming eigenaar is false
    and the text is equal to "Awb 4:5 - aanvraag onvolledig"
    otherwise the relatie tot woning is "huurder"
    and it is not the case that the toestemming eigenaar is a truth value
    and the text is equal to "Awb 4:5 - aanvraag onvolledig"
    otherwise it is not the case that the provincie woning is a third text
    and the text is equal to "Awb 4:5 - aanvraag onvolledig"
    otherwise it is not the case that the aanvraag datum is a fourth text
    and the text is equal to "Awb 4:5 - aanvraag onvolledig"
    otherwise the text is equal to "Awb 4:5 - aanvraag volledig".

